      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "this whole thing is just a cash grab on the existing economy of the creator community, they just want a slice of the pie. This is in no way good for creators on this platform. Its just more greedy behavior from a company that already had $80 million given to it by vive and fb to develop the platform. They have vrc+ which was a concession by the community to keep this platform on life support because it decided to go and implement udon without a license from unity and got sued. This is overreaching. I hate this.\n\nIn no uncertain terms I hate it.\n\nThis is wrong and abuse of the users.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
