      "value": "my concern is if an avatar is sold on the VRChat marketplace is it sold as an inventory item or files. i !LOATHE ENTIRELY! any and all avatar content maker's/sellers who think its a great idea to not give access to the avatar files and instead want to upload it to your account directly so you don't have access to the mesh files. if avatar's that are sold on the vrchat marketplace do not come with downloadable source files then vrchat is truely to far gone and il be moving to the other vr platforms and my 10k hours on vrchat will be a regret i have",
