      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{657ae2bc7f825e68f8119cb5|full_name}: Guess what?  Creators already do all those things!  Also maintaining an online platform costs money to cover bandwidth, hardware, and staffing cause infrastructure isn't cheap!\n\nYou know what the Creator Economy actually does?  It CENTRALIZES the marketplace for avatar creators and prefab builders, so instead of having to hunt up a github repro, gumroad or booth storefront, you'd just click and purchase directly removing a chunk of inertia between curiosity and a purchase.",
