      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I feel one main thing is that it's sort of counter-intuitive for creators in the sense that creators that were already being supported through Patreon or something earn much more there than they could potentially on VRChat. This is because VRChat has a 50/50 revenue split, so creators only get 50% of the profit. For a game entirely revolving around user-generated content, it feels backwards to go 50/50.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
