  "details": "I do not see Vrchat having a ingame currency as a good idea, having to buy things in a map or having to pay to use an avatar of any kind is stupid. Vrchat already has a stable player base as is despite the increased amount of bugs and glitches that happen every update (Quest being the main one) having a in game currency on a game that is free to play other than having vrchat plus is not something everyone like me is going to want to deal with. its only going to make people not want to play it i know that it may help get more money for the game, but that only depends on how well it works, if it ends up only becoming a problem or an exploit, it will only get worse for the game. yea that is my take on this in-game currency thing coming out soon. plz don't get pissy in the comments this is merely my opinion.",
